    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "The targeted user for GestUR Car is a common man next door named Dilbert. Dilbert is working for a technology firm in San Francisco and he lives with his family. Dilbert drives to office every morning and drives back in the evening. Usually he faces a lot of traffic on his way because he drives during office rush hours on weekdays. Just like most of us Dilbert likes to spend his weekends doing something fun. He often drives to vacations or shopping over weekends or holidays. He loves exploring new places and is an extreme user of maps. He also enjoys going on long drives whenever he has free time. He is also a frequent air traveler so he requires frequent airport pick-ups in car.",
